				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・すごい端に配置してくれれば</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</CommentCell>
